  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor 2005-2026 Nissan Frontier 5FT\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR soft roll up tonneau cover is compatible with the 5' bed of 2005-2026 Nissan Frontier(NOT FOR México).\nPainless Operation: No-drill clamps fasten the tonneau cover rails to your truck bed; Easy installation with instructions and mounting hardware included; Access the entire bed by simply rolling the cover up to bulkhead\nWater-proof: Arched crossbars are specially designed to enable water flow off the surface, preventing water accumulation and potential damage caused by the extra weight\nQuality That Lasts: Double-layer PVC cover resists tear and abrasion for long-lasting use; Sturdy aluminum framework and side rails work seamlessly with stainless steel clamps to create a strong and secure seal\nTension & Latch System: Reliable spring latching system pairs with an adjustable tension system to maintain a tight and even fit, preventing the cover from getting wrinkles or folds so you enjoy all-around protection regardless of inclement weather",
